xyZuz5_80SgQ7kNvwGS7CHz&_nc_oc=Adof_v-GZ83Bs52hiBrJEWMr9cSdx3ownz9o9tBeVdf-kbdlh3mU5_ydGlWYTp2tIgs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMfNMDnRhvDf2dSYpYWrf_eYyehXp_QyXQLnGLUogX5_g&oe=6ADF6037"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_yQRa4GSUUQQ7kNvwF17JrK&_nc_oc=AdqBwhQKmZQIwkW0mxA8g4NXzUIqRyDzfQOiZ5RSVHONmanLuXo2qdg5yfLwhgos39E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM4Az8PpGCQiThs4RkZvJyGZkQxSKVIZnZSe3CmEr93gg&oe=6ADF61CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gIKfiWMsnj4Q7kNvwF__Kp0&_nc_oc=AdoT1QMD9K62gaAqxYc4z3wBAr4c5VbDv3QgopRybnmry_VO_RsuwZfm6vizH85Q__U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMd56JXZmv5aNrPQK8t7QGsiC3nfF3CGNATrrBye0vWOQ&oe=6ADF4EEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b6bYgqfme2YQ7kNvwH15Dzi&_nc_oc=AdqYP4cwIV67yfYeHVBYX7aqRnZrTIFGIsFLCWzYbUC6_9S9wx5EbzTX4idQVzxtYpo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN-aAPhTQIZYR3dfyHXqdCRjCzFkeNc2vLgi9o8UnLu7g&oe=6ADF7083"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H8VN2cu-niAQ7kNvwHaUUcc&_nc_oc=AdqZKhRJWU6X4rxkgdkz-KORZxOBiKG3PxvS4Ld35OcZ_-Uw1s80Og7dBXhtLP44Et4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNlrCl32YJP_Z_vFQFWubVEfR1Kf0nTTN5LRf_CsDHglQ&oe=6ADF68D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MzBOcNGiEYcQ7kNvwFZ6WTD&_nc_oc=Adr4WJMlbeQI0XxILcGpfhhS_qqryonDERSlqmDSQoYm7AfIL5wdVapAhaILXSVd3sg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNc26fawUGln37u2DD8ZoWeaL5tbgDpPOgAu-6tiEMldw&oe=6ADF7BFC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080